values
('RA-001','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles - 3-Tab','On the roof surface','Granule loss / bald patches','The protective sandy coating is wearing off your shingles. Once it''s gone the shingle dries out and cracks, and the roof starts leaking.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',9500,13000,17000,18,'High'),
('RA-002','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles - Architectural','On the roof surface','Full replacement due to age or hail','Your shingles have reached the end of their life and need to be replaced before they start leaking.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',12000,15500,22000,28,'High'),
('RA-003','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles - Class 4 Impact Resistant','On the roof surface','Upgrade for hail protection','A tougher shingle built to survive Calgary hail. Costs more up front but often lowers your insurance premium.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',15000,19000,26000,32,'High'),
('RA-004','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles','On the roof surface','Hail damage - bruising and fractures','Hail has bruised the shingles. The damage may not leak today but it shortens roof life significantly and is usually an insurance claim.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',12000,15500,22000,28,'High'),
('RA-005','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles','On the roof surface','Lifted, curled or cupped shingles','Shingles are curling at the edges. Wind can get underneath and tear them off, and water can get in.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',450,900,1800,0,'Medium'),
('RA-006','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles','On the roof surface','Missing shingles (wind damage)','Wind has torn shingles off. The underlayment underneath is exposed and will leak if not fixed.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,650,1400,0,'High'),
('RA-007','roof_attic','Asphalt Shingles','On the roof surface','Multiple layers (2+ layers present)','There is more than one roof stacked on top of the other. When it''s time to replace, all layers must come off, which raises the cost.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Note',1200,1800,2800,0,'Medium'),
('RA-008','roof_attic','Cedar Shake Roof','On the roof surface','Splitting, cupping, moss growth','Wood shakes are splitting and holding moisture. They rot from the underside and need regular maintenance.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',28000,38000,55000,30,'Medium'),
('RA-009','roof_attic','Metal Roof','On the roof surface','Full replacement (standing seam)','A long-life metal roof. Expensive up front but often the last roof the house will need.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',26000,36000,52000,50,'Medium'),
('RA-010','roof_attic','Metal Roof','On the roof surface','Loose or backed-out fasteners','Screws holding the panels are working loose. Each one is a potential leak point.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',900,1800,3500,0,'Medium'),
('RA-011','roof_attic','Flat / Low-Slope Roof (SBS or EPDM)','Flat section of roof, often over an addition or garage','Membrane blistering, seam separation, ponding water','The flat roof membrane is failing. Water sitting on it will eventually find its way through.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',7500,11000,16000,22,'Medium'),
('RA-012','roof_attic','Flat / Low-Slope Roof','Flat section of roof','Ponding water (no positive drainage)','Water is pooling instead of draining. Standing water is the number one killer of flat roofs.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',2200,4500,9000,0,'Medium'),
('RA-013','roof_attic','Roof Flashing - Step / Wall','Where the roof meets a wall or chimney','Rusted, loose, or improperly lapped flashing','The metal that seals the joint between roof and wall has failed. This is one of the most common leak sources in a house.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',550,1100,2200,25,'High'),
('RA-014','roof_attic','Roof Flashing - Valley','In the V where two roof slopes meet','Rusted through / debris packed / improperly installed','The valley carries the most water on your roof. If the flashing there fails, you get an active leak fast.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',700,1400,2800,25,'High'),
('RA-015','roof_attic','Chimney Flashing & Counterflashing','Around the chimney where it passes through the roof','Missing counterflashing, failed sealant, no cricket','Water is getting in around the chimney. Chimney flashing is the single most common roof leak we find.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',800,1600,3200,25,'High'),
('RA-016','roof_attic','Plumbing Vent Boot / Pipe Jack','Small pipe sticking up through the roof','Cracked rubber boot','The rubber collar around the vent pipe has dried and cracked. Small part, but it leaks straight into the attic.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',180,320,550,15,'High'),
('RA-017','roof_attic','Roof Decking / Sheathing','Wood layer under the shingles','Rot, delamination, sagging between rafters','The wood under your shingles has gotten wet and rotted. It has to be replaced before new shingles go on.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',150,280,450,60,'High'),
('RA-018','roof_attic','Eavestrough / Gutters','Along the edge of the roof','Clogged, sagging, or leaking at seams','Your gutters aren''t moving water away from the house. That water ends up at your foundation.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',400,900,1800,0,'High'),
('RA-019','roof_attic','Eavestrough / Gutters','Along the edge of the roof','Full replacement (5in continuous aluminum)','New seamless gutters to carry roof water away from the foundation.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',1500,2600,4200,25,'High'),
('RA-020','roof_attic','Downspouts & Extensions','Vertical pipes at corners of the house','Discharging at foundation / missing extension','Roof water is dumping right beside your foundation instead of away from it. Cheapest fix in the house for one of the most expensive problems.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',60,140,300,25,'High'),
('RA-021','roof_attic','Attic Insulation','In the attic above your ceiling','Insufficient depth (below R-50 / R-60 code)','There isn''t enough insulation up there. You''re paying to heat the sky, and in Calgary it also causes ice dams.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',2400,3600,6600,0,'High'),
('RA-022','roof_attic','Attic Insulation','In the attic above your ceiling','Full removal and replacement (contaminated)','The existing insulation is contaminated (rodents, mould, or water damage) and has to come out before new goes in.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',6000,9000,13200,0,'Medium'),
('RA-023','roof_attic','Vermiculite Insulation (Zonolite)','In the attic, looks like grey-brown pebbles','Presence of vermiculite - possible asbestos','This type of insulation may contain asbestos. It is not dangerous if left undisturbed, but it must be professionally removed before any attic work.','HIGH','moderate','Before any attic work','Test / Abate',12000,20000,32000,0,'Medium'),
('RA-024','roof_attic','Attic Ventilation - Soffit Vents','Underside of the roof overhang','Blocked by insulation or painted shut','Your attic can''t breathe. Trapped heat and moisture rot the roof deck from underneath and cause ice dams.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',500,1100,2200,0,'High'),
('RA-025','roof_attic','Attic Ventilation - Roof/Ridge Vents','Along the peak of the roof','Insufficient exhaust ventilation','Not enough vents to let hot moist air escape the attic. Code requires 1 sq ft of vent per 150 sq ft of attic.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',350,800,1600,25,'High'),
('RA-026','roof_attic','Attic Rain / Frost Accumulation','In the attic, visible as frost on the underside of the roof','Heavy frost buildup that melts in spring','Warm moist air from the house is leaking into the cold attic and freezing. When it thaws it looks exactly like a roof leak.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',1200,2800,6500,0,'Medium'),
('RA-027','roof_attic','Attic Hatch / Access Door','Ceiling of a closet or hallway','Uninsulated and unsealed hatch','The attic hatch is a hole in your insulation. Warm air pours straight up through it.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Repair',150,300,600,0,'High'),
('RA-028','roof_attic','Bathroom Exhaust Fan Duct','In the attic, flexible duct from the bathroom fan','Terminating in the attic instead of outside','Your bathroom fan is blowing hot wet air into your attic. That is a mould and attic rain factory.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,500,1100,0,'High'),
('RA-029','roof_attic','Attic Structure - Truss / Rafter','Wood framing in the attic','Cut, notched, or modified truss members','Someone cut into the roof framing, usually for storage or a duct. Trusses are engineered and cutting one compromises the whole roof.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',1200,3000,8000,0,'Medium'),
('RA-030','roof_attic','Attic Structure - Sheathing','Wood layer visible from inside the attic','Dark staining / mould on underside of sheathing','Black staining on the roof boards means the attic has had a long-term moisture problem. Needs the moisture source fixed, not just cleaned.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',1800,3600,7500,0,'Medium'),
('RA-031','roof_attic','Skylight','Window in the roof','Leaking at flashing or failed seal','The skylight is letting water in. Skylights are a common leak point and flashing kits are unit-specific.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',600,1400,3000,25,'Medium'),
('RA-032','roof_attic','Skylight','Window in the roof','Full replacement','The skylight unit itself has failed (fogged glass, rotted frame) and needs replacing.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',1800,3200,6000,25,'Medium'),
('RA-033','roof_attic','Ice Dam Damage','Along the eaves in winter','Ice buildup at roof edge causing backup leaks','Ice is forming at the roof edge and forcing water back under the shingles. It''s a symptom of attic heat loss, not a roof defect.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',2500,5500,12000,0,'Medium'),
('RA-034','roof_attic','Roof Tune-Up / Maintenance','Whole roof','Preventive service (sealant, fastener, debris)','A routine roof service to catch small issues before they become leaks. Recommended every 2-3 years in Calgary.','LOW','minor','Annual/biennial','Service',350,550,900,0,'High'),
('RA-035','roof_attic','Chimney - Masonry Cap & Crown','Top of the chimney above the roof','Cracked crown / missing cap','The concrete cap on top of the chimney is cracked. Water gets into the masonry and freeze-thaw tears the chimney apart.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',450,950,2200,25,'Medium'),
('RA-036','roof_attic','Chimney - Masonry Repointing','Chimney above the roofline','Deteriorated mortar joints','The mortar between the bricks is crumbling. Left alone the chimney becomes unstable.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',1200,2800,6500,0,'Medium'),
('HV-001','hvac','Forced Air Furnace - High Efficiency (95%+)','Mechanical room, usually the basement','End of life / failed heat exchanger','Your furnace has reached the end of its life and needs replacing. In Calgary this is not optional heading into winter.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',5000,6300,11000,20,'High'),
('HV-002','hvac','Forced Air Furnace - Mid Efficiency (80%)','Mechanical room, usually the basement','Obsolete unit, chimney vented','An older style furnace that vents up the chimney. Less efficient and no longer sold new in Alberta.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',5000,6300,9500,20,'High'),
('HV-003','hvac','Furnace Heat Exchanger','Inside the furnace cabinet','Cracked heat exchanger','A crack in the heat exchanger can leak carbon monoxide into your home. The furnace must be shut down immediately.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Replace',5000,6300,11000,20,'High'),
('HV-004','hvac','Furnace','Mechanical room','Dirty / neglected - no service records','The furnace hasn''t been serviced. Annual maintenance catches problems early and keeps the warranty valid.','LOW','minor','Annual','Service',120,190,320,0,'High'),
('HV-005','hvac','Furnace Blower Motor','Inside the furnace cabinet','Failed or noisy blower motor','The fan that pushes air through your house has failed. Common repair on units 10+ years old.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',550,950,1800,15,'Medium'),
('HV-006','hvac','Furnace Ignitor / Flame Sensor','Inside the furnace cabinet','Failed ignitor - furnace won''t light','A common wear part. Inexpensive fix that usually gets the furnace running the same day.','HIGH','critical','Immediate (winter)','Repair',200,350,600,7,'High'),
('HV-007','hvac','Furnace Venting (PVC / B-Vent)','Pipes leaving the furnace to the outside','Improper slope, disconnected joint, or blocked termination','The exhaust pipe isn''t installed correctly. This can push combustion gases back into your home.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',350,800,2000,0,'Medium'),
('HV-008','hvac','Boiler - Hot Water Heating','Mechanical room','End of life / leaking sections','The boiler that heats your radiators or in-floor heat is at the end of its life.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',8000,12000,20000,25,'Medium'),
('HV-009','hvac','Boiler','Mechanical room','Annual service overdue','Boilers need yearly service. Skipping it shortens life and voids most warranties.','LOW','minor','Annual','Service',200,320,500,0,'Medium'),
('HV-010','hvac','Hydronic Circulator Pump','Mechanical room, attached to boiler piping','Seized or noisy pump','The pump that moves hot water through your heating loops has failed. That zone stops heating.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',400,750,1400,12,'Medium'),
('HV-011','hvac','In-Floor Radiant Heating - Manifold','Mechanical room','Leaking manifold or failed zone valve','Part of your in-floor heating system is leaking or a zone has stopped working.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',700,1500,3200,25,'Medium'),
('HV-012','hvac','Kitec In-Floor Heating Tubing','Buried in the concrete floor slab','Kitec tubing present - known failure risk','Kitec is a recalled pipe that corrodes and fails. In a floor slab, a failure means cutting up concrete.','HIGH','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',9000,16000,30000,0,'Low'),
('HV-013','hvac','Central Air Conditioner','Outside unit beside the house, plus coil in the furnace','End of life / R-22 refrigerant system','Your AC uses a refrigerant that is no longer manufactured. Repairs are expensive and replacement is usually the better call.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',4980,6500,8600,15,'High'),
('HV-014','hvac','Central Air Conditioner','Outside unit beside the house','Refrigerant leak / low charge','The system is low on refrigerant, which means there is a leak somewhere. Topping it up without finding the leak is throwing money away.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',400,900,2200,0,'Medium'),
('HV-015','hvac','Central Air Conditioner','Outside unit beside the house','Condenser coil bent, dirty, or hail damaged','The outdoor coil is damaged or clogged. The system works harder, costs more to run, and fails sooner.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Service',150,280,500,0,'High'),
('HV-016','hvac','Air Source Heat Pump','Outside unit beside the house','New installation / replacement','A heat pump provides both heating and cooling. In Calgary it needs a backup furnace for deep cold.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',6000,9500,16000,18,'High'),
('HV-017','hvac','Ductless Mini-Split','Wall-mounted indoor head plus outdoor unit','New installation for a zone without ducting','A ductless system for a specific room or an addition that the main furnace can''t reach.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',4500,6500,10000,18,'High'),
('HV-018','hvac','Ductwork - Supply & Return','Behind walls and ceilings, visible in the basement','Disconnected or leaking duct joints','Heated air is leaking into your basement or walls instead of reaching the rooms. Rooms feel cold and bills go up.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',400,900,2000,0,'Medium'),
('HV-019','hvac','Ductwork','Basement ceiling and behind walls','Undersized or missing returns','There aren''t enough return air vents. The system can''t breathe properly and rooms heat unevenly.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',500,1100,2400,0,'Medium'),
('HV-020','hvac','Ductwork','Throughout the house','Duct cleaning (excessive dust/debris)','The ducts are full of construction dust or debris. Worth doing after a renovation or if the previous owner had pets.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Service',350,550,900,0,'High'),
('HV-021','hvac','HRV / ERV (Heat Recovery Ventilator)','Mechanical room, box with two insulated ducts','Not functioning / disconnected / never commissioned','This unit brings fresh air into the house without losing heat. Required in newer Alberta homes and often found disconnected.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',250,500,1100,0,'Medium'),
('HV-022','hvac','HRV / ERV','Mechanical room','Replacement of failed unit','The fresh air unit has failed and needs replacing to keep indoor air quality and humidity in check.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',1800,2800,4500,20,'Medium'),
('HV-023','hvac','Thermostat','Hallway wall','Old mechanical / non-programmable','An old thermostat can''t manage setbacks. Upgrading is one of the cheapest efficiency improvements available.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',250,400,700,12,'High'),
('HV-024','hvac','Humidifier (Furnace-Mounted)','Attached to the furnace ductwork','Leaking, scaled, or bypass damper left open','The humidifier is leaking or left running in summer, which drives up indoor humidity and causes window condensation.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',150,400,900,12,'Medium'),
('HV-025','hvac','Air Filter','Slot at the side or bottom of the furnace','Severely clogged filter','A clogged filter chokes the furnace, drives up your bill, and can crack the heat exchanger over time.','LOW','critical','Immediate (DIY)','Service',25,60,140,0,'High'),
('HV-026','hvac','Combustion Air Supply','Mechanical room, pipe or vent to outside','Inadequate or blocked combustion air','Your furnace and water heater need outside air to burn safely. If they can''t get it, they can backdraft exhaust into the house.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',400,900,2200,0,'Medium'),
('HV-027','hvac','Carbon Monoxide Alarm','Hallway near bedrooms and mechanical room','Missing or expired CO alarm','CO alarms expire after 7-10 years. Alberta code requires one near sleeping areas in homes with fuel-burning appliances.','HIGH','critical','Immediate','Replace',45,80,160,8,'High'),
('HV-028','hvac','Garage Heater (Unit Heater)','Mounted on the garage ceiling or wall','Improper venting or clearance to combustibles','A gas garage heater installed too close to combustible materials or vented incorrectly is a fire and CO risk.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',600,1500,3500,18,'Medium'),
('HV-029','hvac','Gas Fireplace Insert','Living room or family room','No service records / pilot won''t stay lit','The fireplace hasn''t been serviced. Gas appliances need regular inspection for safe operation.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Service',180,350,700,20,'High'),
('HV-030','hvac','Wood Burning Fireplace / Chimney','Living room, chimney above the roof','Creosote buildup - no sweep records','Creosote is a flammable tar that builds up in the chimney. It is the direct cause of chimney fires.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Service',250,450,900,0,'High'),
('HV-031','hvac','Chimney Liner','Inside the masonry chimney','Missing or damaged liner','The clay or steel liner inside your chimney is damaged. An unlined chimney can let heat and gases reach the framing.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',2200,3800,7000,30,'Medium'),
('HV-032','hvac','Whole-Home Air Cleaner / Electronic Filter','Attached to the furnace','Non-functional or bypassed','The air cleaner isn''t working. Not a safety issue but you''re not getting the filtration you paid for.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Repair',300,800,1800,15,'Medium'),
('HV-033','hvac','Zone Control System','Mechanical room, dampers in ductwork','Failed damper motor or control board','One part of the house won''t heat or cool because a zone damper has failed.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',400,850,1800,15,'Medium'),
('HV-034','hvac','Gas Line / Piping','Mechanical room and to appliances','Corroded, unsupported, or improperly sized gas piping','Gas piping issues are a safety concern and must be corrected by a licensed gas fitter.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,900,2500,0,'Medium'),
('HV-035','hvac','CSST Gas Piping (Yellow Flexible)','Visible in mechanical room and attic','Not properly bonded to ground','This flexible yellow gas line must be electrically bonded. Without bonding, a nearby lightning strike can puncture it.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,650,1400,0,'Medium'),
('HV-036','hvac','Whole House Humidity / Sweaty Walls','Interior walls and windows','Excess humidity causing condensation','Too much moisture in the house is condensing on cold surfaces. Left alone this becomes mould.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',300,1200,3500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-001','electrical','Main Electrical Panel - 100A','Mechanical room, basement, or garage','Federal Pioneer Stab-Lok panel present','This brand of breaker has a documented history of failing to trip during an overload, which is a fire risk. Many insurers flag it.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',2800,3800,5500,40,'High'),
('EL-002','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room, basement, or garage','Upgrade 100A to 200A service (overhead)','More capacity for modern loads like AC, EV chargers, and hot tubs. Requires utility coordination.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',4000,5000,6500,40,'High'),
('EL-003','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room, basement, or garage','Upgrade 100A to 200A service (underground)','Same upgrade but the service line is buried, which means excavation and much higher cost.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',7000,9500,14000,40,'High'),
('EL-004','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Zinsco / Sylvania-Zinsco panel present','Another obsolete panel brand with known breaker failure issues. Replacement is the standard recommendation.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',2800,3800,5500,40,'Medium'),
('EL-005','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Double-tapped breakers','Two wires are jammed under one breaker terminal designed for a single wire. Loose connections here start fires.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,500,1100,0,'High'),
('EL-006','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Missing or damaged dead front cover','The cover that protects you from live parts is missing or won''t seat properly. Direct shock hazard.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',150,350,800,0,'High'),
('EL-007','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Missing knockouts / open panel openings','Open holes in the panel let fingers and rodents reach live parts.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',80,150,300,0,'Medium'),
('EL-008','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Insufficient working clearance (under 1m)','Code requires clear space in front of the panel so an electrician can work safely and shut power off in an emergency.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',0,400,3500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-009','electrical','Main Electrical Panel','Mechanical room','Unlabeled or incorrect circuit directory','Nobody can tell which breaker controls what. Dangerous in an emergency and a code deficiency.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',250,450,800,0,'Medium'),
('EL-010','electrical','Subpanel','Garage, basement, or addition','Neutrals and grounds bonded at subpanel','In a subpanel the neutral and ground must be separated. Bonding them creates current on grounding paths.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,500,1100,0,'Medium'),
('EL-011','electrical','Branch Wiring - Aluminum (Pre-1980)','Behind walls, visible at outlets and panel','Aluminum branch circuit wiring present','Aluminum wire expands and contracts more than copper, loosening connections over time. Insurers often require remediation.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',2500,4500,7000,0,'High'),
('EL-012','electrical','Branch Wiring - Aluminum','Behind walls','COPALUM crimp remediation','The premium remediation method. More expensive but considered the gold standard by insurers.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',4500,7000,10000,0,'High'),
('EL-013','electrical','Branch Wiring - Knob and Tube','Attic, basement ceiling, behind walls','Active knob and tube wiring present','Very old wiring with no ground and cloth insulation that crumbles. Most insurers will not write a policy with it active.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Replace',8000,10500,13000,0,'High'),
('EL-014','electrical','Whole House Rewire','Behind all walls and ceilings','Full rewire, 2-storey home','Complete replacement of all branch wiring. Major disruption but resets the electrical system for 50+ years.','HIGH','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',15000,20000,26000,60,'High'),
('EL-015','electrical','Receptacles (Outlets)','Throughout the house','Ungrounded two-prong outlets','These outlets have no ground wire. Any appliance with a three-prong plug has no safety path.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',90,160,300,35,'Medium'),
('EL-016','electrical','Receptacles (Outlets)','Throughout the house','Reversed polarity','The hot and neutral wires are swapped. Appliances stay partly energized even when switched off.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',70,130,250,0,'Medium'),
('EL-017','electrical','Receptacles (Outlets)','Throughout the house','Open ground / open neutral','A wire connection is missing or broken. Shock hazard and unreliable operation.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',90,180,400,0,'Medium'),
('EL-018','electrical','GFCI Protection','Kitchen, bathrooms, garage, exterior, unfinished basement','Missing GFCI protection in wet locations','GFCI outlets shut off power in milliseconds if current leaks. Required anywhere near water.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',150,250,450,25,'High'),
('EL-019','electrical','AFCI Protection','Bedroom and living area circuits','Missing AFCI protection','Arc fault breakers detect the kind of sparking that starts fires inside walls. Required on most modern circuits.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',120,200,350,25,'Medium'),
('EL-020','electrical','Light Fixtures','Throughout the house','Exposed bulbs in closets / improper clearance','A bare bulb in a closet too close to stored items is a fire risk. Code requires enclosed fixtures.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',90,180,350,0,'Medium'),
('EL-021','electrical','Light Fixtures - Recessed Pot Lights','Ceilings throughout','Non-IC rated cans buried in insulation','These fixtures aren''t rated for contact with insulation and can overheat. Common attic fire cause.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',120,220,400,25,'Medium'),
('EL-022','electrical','Junction Boxes','Attic, basement, behind walls','Open splices / no junction box','Wire connections outside a proper box are exposed and are a code violation and fire risk.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',80,150,300,0,'Medium'),
('EL-023','electrical','Junction Boxes','Behind drywall','Buried / concealed junction box','A connection was drywalled over. Code requires all boxes stay accessible for inspection.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',150,350,700,0,'Medium'),
('EL-024','electrical','Service Entrance / Mast','Outside wall where power enters the house','Loose mast, damaged weatherhead, or frayed drip loop','The connection where utility power enters the house is damaged. Requires utility coordination to repair.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',600,1400,3000,40,'Medium'),
('EL-025','electrical','Grounding Electrode System','Outside near the panel, buried rod or water pipe','Missing or corroded ground rod / no bonding','The house has no proper path to ground. Every safety device depends on this working.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,700,1400,40,'Medium'),
('EL-026','electrical','Water Line Bonding','Mechanical room at the water meter','Missing bonding jumper across water meter','A required jumper is missing. Without it the metal plumbing may not be safely grounded.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',150,280,500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-027','electrical','Smoke Alarms','Hallways and bedrooms','Missing, expired, or non-interconnected','Smoke alarms expire in 10 years. Alberta code requires them on every level and in each bedroom.','HIGH','critical','Immediate','Replace',55,110,220,10,'High'),
('EL-028','electrical','Exterior Receptacles','Outside walls, deck, patio','Missing weatherproof in-use cover','Outdoor outlets need a cover that stays sealed while a cord is plugged in. Otherwise water gets in.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',70,140,260,20,'Medium'),
('EL-029','electrical','EV Charger Circuit','Garage wall','New Level 2 EV charger installation','A dedicated 240V circuit for charging an electric vehicle. May require a panel upgrade first.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',1200,2200,4500,20,'High'),
('EL-030','electrical','Hot Tub / Spa Circuit','Backyard, deck','Improper or missing GFCI disconnect','A spa needs a dedicated GFCI-protected disconnect within sight. Water plus electricity is unforgiving.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',900,1700,3200,25,'Medium'),
('EL-031','electrical','Extension Cords as Permanent Wiring','Basements, garages, workshops','Extension cords used in place of fixed wiring','Extension cords are for temporary use. Permanent use overloads them and is a common fire cause.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,700,1500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-032','electrical','Overloaded Circuits','Throughout the house','Too many devices on one circuit / frequent breaker trips','The circuit is being asked to carry more than it was designed for. Breakers tripping is the warning sign.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,700,1500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-033','electrical','Kitchen Split Receptacles','Kitchen counter','Missing split receptacles or dedicated circuits','Kitchen counters need dedicated circuits so appliances don''t trip breakers. Common gap in older homes.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',400,800,1600,0,'Medium'),
('EL-034','electrical','Arc / Scorch Marks at Devices','Outlets, switches, panel','Visible burning or melting at a device','Something has already overheated here. This is evidence of an active fault, not a future risk.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',200,550,1500,0,'Medium'),
('EL-035','electrical','Solar PV System','Roof','Existing array - condition and interconnection unknown','A rooftop solar system. Needs its own inspection for mounting, wiring, and utility interconnection.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Note',300,600,1200,30,'Medium'),
('EL-036','electrical','Doorbell / Low Voltage Transformer','Mechanical room or near the panel','Failed transformer or corroded wiring','Minor item. The doorbell transformer has failed.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Repair',90,170,320,25,'Medium'),
('EX-001','exterior','Grading / Soil Slope','Ground around the perimeter of the house','Negative slope toward foundation','The ground slopes toward your house instead of away. Every rainfall and snowmelt drains straight at your foundation.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',900,2200,5000,0,'Medium'),
('EX-002','exterior','Weeping Tile / Perimeter Drain','Buried around the foundation footing','Failed, collapsed, or clogged weeping tile (interior system)','The buried drain that relieves water pressure at your foundation has failed. Interior replacement means breaking the basement slab.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',8400,11500,14400,50,'High'),
('EX-003','exterior','Weeping Tile / Perimeter Drain','Buried around the foundation footing','Exterior replacement with waterproofing membrane','Full excavation around the house to replace the drain and waterproof the foundation wall. The permanent fix, and the expensive one.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',7000,12000,22000,50,'High'),
('EX-004','exterior','Foundation - Poured Concrete','Basement walls, visible from inside','Vertical hairline shrinkage crack','A thin vertical crack is usually normal concrete shrinkage, not structural. It still needs sealing to keep water out.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',250,500,800,0,'High'),
('EX-005','exterior','Foundation - Poured Concrete','Basement walls','Active leaking crack','Water is coming through the foundation. Injection from the inside usually solves it.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',500,950,1500,0,'High'),
('EX-006','exterior','Foundation - Poured Concrete','Basement walls','Horizontal crack with inward bowing','A horizontal crack means soil pressure is pushing the wall in. This is structural and needs an engineer.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',3500,8000,20000,0,'Medium'),
('EX-007','exterior','Foundation - Concrete Block','Basement walls','Stair-step cracking through mortar joints','Cracking that follows the block joints in a stair pattern usually points to differential settlement.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',3000,7500,18000,0,'Medium'),
('EX-008','exterior','Foundation','Under the house','Settlement requiring underpinning / piles','The foundation is sinking unevenly and needs to be supported on piles driven to stable soil.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',1200,2200,3800,0,'Medium'),
('EX-009','exterior','Foundation - Wood (PWF)','Basement walls','Preserved wood foundation showing rot or movement','A wood foundation. If the preservative treatment or drainage has failed, the structure is at risk.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',4000,9000,20000,60,'Medium'),
('EX-010','exterior','Foundation Parging','Exposed foundation above ground level','Cracked, spalling, or missing parging','The cement coating on the exposed foundation is falling off. Mostly cosmetic but it does protect the concrete.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',600,1400,2800,25,'Medium'),
('EX-011','exterior','Exterior Cladding - Vinyl Siding','Exterior walls','Full replacement (age, hail, warping)','The siding on your house needs replacing. Vinyl is the most common and most affordable option in Calgary.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',9000,14000,22000,35,'High'),
('EX-012','exterior','Exterior Cladding - Vinyl Siding','Exterior walls','Hail damage - cracked and holed panels','Hail has punched through the siding. Water gets behind and rots the sheathing. Usually an insurance claim.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',9000,14000,22000,35,'Medium'),
('EX-013','exterior','Exterior Cladding - Stucco / Acrylic','Exterior walls','Cracking, delamination, or missing control joints','The stucco is cracking. Water getting behind stucco is very destructive because it can''t dry out.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',2400,4500,9000,45,'Medium'),
('EX-014','exterior','Exterior Cladding - Fibre Cement (Hardie)','Exterior walls','Full replacement / upgrade','A durable long-life cladding. Costs more than vinyl but performs much better in hail.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',20000,30000,45000,50,'Medium'),
('EX-015','exterior','Exterior Cladding','Exterior walls','Insufficient clearance to grade (under 6in)','The siding is buried in the soil. It wicks moisture up into the wall and invites insects.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',400,1100,2600,0,'Medium'),
('EX-016','exterior','Windows - Vinyl Double Pane','All exterior walls','Failed seal / fogged glass','The seal between the panes has failed and moisture is trapped inside. Insulation value is gone.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',800,1400,2100,25,'High'),
('EX-017','exterior','Windows','All exterior walls','Whole-home window replacement','Replacing all windows. Big project, meaningful comfort and efficiency gain in Calgary winters.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',12000,20000,32000,25,'High'),
('EX-018','exterior','Windows - Single Pane','Older homes','Single pane glazing present','Single pane windows have almost no insulation value and will frost and condense heavily in Calgary.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',800,1400,2100,25,'Medium'),
('EX-019','exterior','Windows','All exterior walls','Failed perimeter caulking / missing flashing','The seal around the window has failed. Water gets into the wall assembly where you can''t see it.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',80,180,400,10,'Medium'),
('EX-020','exterior','Exterior Doors','Front, back, and garage entries','Failed weatherstripping / air leakage','You can feel the draft. Cheap fix with an immediate comfort payoff.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',80,180,350,10,'Medium'),
('EX-021','exterior','Exterior Doors','Front and back entries','Full door replacement (rot, damage, poor fit)','The door itself needs replacing due to rot, damage, or a poor original installation.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',1200,2200,4500,30,'Medium'),
('EX-022','exterior','Deck - Wood Framed','Off the back of the house','Ledger board improperly attached to house','The deck is attached to the house with nails instead of proper bolts. This is the single most common cause of deck collapses.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',800,1800,3800,0,'Medium'),
('EX-023','exterior','Deck - Wood Framed','Off the back of the house','Rotted joists, posts, or decking','The wood is rotting. Depending on where, this ranges from board replacement to a full rebuild.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',1500,4000,9000,20,'Medium'),
('EX-024','exterior','Deck - Wood Framed','Off the back of the house','Full deck replacement','The deck has reached the end of its life and needs rebuilding.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',6000,10000,18000,20,'Medium'),
('EX-025','exterior','Deck Railings','Deck perimeter','Loose railing or spacing over 4in','Loose railings and wide baluster gaps are a fall hazard, especially for children.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',600,1400,2800,20,'Medium'),
('EX-026','exterior','Driveway - Concrete','In front of the garage','Cracked, heaved, or settled slab','The driveway concrete is cracked or has heaved. In Calgary this is usually frost movement.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',4800,8400,13200,35,'Medium'),
('EX-027','exterior','Driveway - Concrete','In front of the garage','Settled slab sloping toward the house','The driveway is tilting back toward the house and sending water at the foundation. Mudjacking can lift it.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',1200,2400,4500,0,'Medium'),
('EX-028','exterior','Sidewalk / Walkway','Around the house','Trip hazard from heaved sections','Uneven sections are a trip hazard and a liability if someone falls.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,550,1200,35,'Medium'),
('EX-029','exterior','Retaining Wall','Yard, sloped areas','Leaning, bulging, or failing wall','The wall holding back soil is failing. Walls over 1.2m generally need an engineered design and permit.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',3500,7500,16000,30,'Medium'),
('EX-030','exterior','Garage - Attached','Attached to the house','Missing or breached fire separation to house','The wall and ceiling between garage and house must resist fire spread. Holes and gaps defeat that.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',600,1400,3200,0,'Medium'),
('EX-031','exterior','Garage - Man Door to House','Between garage and house','Missing self-closer or non-rated door','The door from the garage into the house must be fire-rated and self-closing to keep exhaust and fire out.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',500,1000,2000,30,'Medium'),
('EX-032','exterior','Garage Overhead Door','Garage front','Failed auto-reverse safety sensors','The safety sensor that stops the door from closing on a person or pet isn''t working.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',150,320,650,15,'Medium'),
('EX-033','exterior','Garage Overhead Door','Garage front','Door or opener at end of life','The garage door or the opener has worn out.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',1800,3200,5500,25,'Medium'),
('EX-034','exterior','Garage Slab','Garage floor','Cracking, spalling, or drainage pooling','The garage floor is deteriorating or water pools instead of draining out.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',2000,4000,8000,40,'Medium'),
('EX-035','exterior','Soffit & Fascia','Under the roof overhang','Damaged, missing, or rotted sections','The trim under your roof edge is damaged. It protects the roof structure and provides attic ventilation.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',1200,2600,5000,35,'Medium'),
('EX-036','exterior','Exterior Hose Bibs','Outside walls','No frost-free bib or missing shutoff','A standard tap will freeze and split the pipe inside the wall. Calgary winters make this a when, not an if.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Replace',250,450,900,25,'Medium'),
('EX-037','exterior','Trees & Vegetation','Around the house','Trees or shrubs contacting the house or roof','Branches rubbing the roof wear shingles and give rodents a bridge into your attic. Roots can also reach the sewer line.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Service',200,500,1500,0,'Medium'),
('EX-038','exterior','Window Wells','Around basement windows','No drainage / filled with debris / no cover','The well beside your basement window fills with water and it comes straight through the window.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,650,1500,25,'Medium'),
('PL-001','plumbing','Supply Piping - Poly-B (Polybutylene)','Behind walls and ceilings, grey plastic pipe','Poly-B piping present','Poly-B was installed in Calgary homes from roughly 1985-1997. It degrades from chlorine in the water and fails without warning. Insurers surcharge or decline it.','HIGH','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',8000,12000,18000,0,'High'),
('PL-002','plumbing','Supply Piping - Kitec','Behind walls, orange and blue pipe with brass fittings','Kitec piping present','Kitec is a recalled pipe whose brass fittings corrode and fail. Class action settlement funds are exhausted.','HIGH','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',8000,12000,15000,0,'Medium'),
('PL-003','plumbing','Supply Piping - Galvanized Steel','Basement ceiling, behind walls','Galvanized supply lines present','Old galvanized pipe rusts from the inside. You get reduced pressure, discoloured water, and eventual leaks.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',7000,11000,16000,50,'Medium'),
('PL-004','plumbing','Supply Piping - Copper','Basement ceiling, behind walls','Pinhole leaks / green corrosion at joints','Copper is developing pinhole leaks, often from water chemistry or improper grounding.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,500,1200,60,'Medium'),
('PL-005','plumbing','Main Water Shutoff Valve','Where the water line enters, usually mechanical room','Seized, leaking, or missing shutoff','If you can''t shut the water off, a burst pipe becomes a flood. Test it yearly.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',300,600,1200,30,'Medium'),
('PL-006','plumbing','Water Heater - Conventional Tank (Natural Draft)','Mechanical room','End of life / rusting tank / leaking','Tank water heaters last 8-12 years. Once the tank leaks it cannot be repaired.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',1750,2200,2800,11,'High'),
('PL-007','plumbing','Water Heater - Power Vent','Mechanical room','End of life / failed blower','A power-vented tank. More expensive than a natural draft unit but required when there is no chimney.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',1800,2500,3500,11,'High'),
('PL-008','plumbing','Water Heater - Tankless','Mechanical room, wall mounted','New installation or replacement','On-demand hot water. Costs more up front, lasts about twice as long as a tank.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',5750,6500,9000,22,'High'),
('PL-009','plumbing','Water Heater - T&P Relief Valve','Top or side of the water heater','Missing, capped, or improperly terminated discharge pipe','This valve stops the tank from exploding. Its discharge pipe must run to within 6in of the floor and must never be capped.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Repair',120,250,500,11,'High'),
('PL-010','plumbing','Water Heater','Mechanical room','No expansion tank on closed system','Without an expansion tank, heated water has nowhere to expand and pressure spikes stress the whole system.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',250,450,800,11,'Medium'),
('PL-011','plumbing','Water Heater','Mechanical room','No seismic/anchor strapping or drain pan','A leaking tank in a finished basement causes far more damage than the tank itself is worth.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',150,350,700,0,'Medium'),
('PL-012','plumbing','Drain, Waste & Vent (DWV) - Cast Iron','Basement ceiling and behind walls','Corroded / scaling cast iron drain stack','Old cast iron drain stacks rust from the inside and eventually crack. Replacement means opening walls.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',2500,5000,10000,60,'Medium'),
('PL-013','plumbing','DWV - Missing or Improper Trap','Under sinks, laundry, floor drains','S-trap present or trap missing','Without a proper trap and vent, sewer gas comes into the house. An S-trap siphons itself dry.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',200,400,900,0,'Medium'),
('PL-014','plumbing','DWV - Venting','Behind walls, up through the roof','Missing or undersized vent','Drains gurgle and empty slowly because there is no air path. Also allows sewer gas in.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',300,700,1600,0,'Medium'),
('PL-015','plumbing','Main Sewer Line - Clay Tile','Buried from the house to the street','Root intrusion / offset joints / collapse','Old clay sewer pipe cracks and lets tree roots in. Backups get more frequent until it fails completely.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',6000,10000,16000,60,'High'),
('PL-016','plumbing','Main Sewer Line - Orangeburg','Buried from the house to the street','Orangeburg (tar paper) pipe present','This pipe is made of layered tar paper. It deforms and collapses. If your home has it, replacement is a matter of when.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',7000,11000,18000,50,'Medium'),
('PL-017','plumbing','Main Sewer Line','Buried from the house to the street','Trenchless relining (CIPP)','A liner is pulled through the existing pipe and cured in place. No digging up the yard.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',4500,7500,12000,50,'High'),
('PL-018','plumbing','Main Sewer Line','Buried from the house to the street','No camera scope performed','A sewer camera inspection is the only way to know the condition of the buried line. Cheap insurance before buying.','LOW','moderate','Before purchase','Service',200,350,600,0,'High'),
('PL-019','plumbing','Backwater Valve','Basement floor, in the sewer line','Missing backwater valve','Without one, a city sewer surcharge can push sewage back up into your basement. Many insurers discount for having one.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',2000,3200,5000,30,'High'),
('PL-020','plumbing','Sump Pump','Basement floor, in a pit','No sump pump where one is needed','A sump pump removes groundwater before it reaches your basement floor. Essential with a high water table.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Replace',2000,3000,4500,10,'High'),
('PL-021','plumbing','Sump Pump','Basement floor, in a pit','Pump failed / no battery backup','The pump has failed or has no backup. Power outages during storms are exactly when you need it most.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',400,900,2200,10,'Medium'),
('PL-022','plumbing','Sump Pump Discharge','Outside near the foundation','Discharging next to the foundation','The pump is moving water out of the basement and dumping it right back beside the foundation.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',150,500,1400,0,'Medium'),
('PL-023','plumbing','Lift Station / Sewage Ejector','Basement floor, sealed pit','Failed pump or unsealed lid','This pumps waste up to the main sewer from a below-grade bathroom. An unsealed lid releases sewer gas.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',900,1800,3800,12,'Medium'),
('PL-024','plumbing','Toilet','Bathrooms','Loose at floor / failed wax ring / rocking','A rocking toilet breaks its seal and leaks under the floor where you can''t see it, rotting the subfloor.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',180,320,650,0,'Medium'),
('PL-025','plumbing','Toilet','Bathrooms','Running / leaking / needs replacement','The toilet is worn out or continuously running, which wastes a surprising amount of water.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',350,600,1200,30,'Medium'),
('PL-026','plumbing','Sink Faucets & Supply Lines','Kitchen and bathrooms','Dripping faucet / corroded supply lines','Old braided supply lines burst without warning. Replacing them is cheap insurance.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',180,400,900,20,'Medium'),
('PL-027','plumbing','Tub & Shower','Bathrooms','Failed grout / caulk / leaking valve','Water is getting behind the tile. This is one of the most common hidden damage sources in a home.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,600,1500,0,'Medium'),
('PL-028','plumbing','Tub & Shower','Bathrooms','Full surround replacement (water damage)','Water has damaged the wall behind the tile and the surround has to come out.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Replace',3000,5500,11000,30,'Medium'),
('PL-029','plumbing','Anti-Scald / Mixing Valve','Shower','No anti-scald protection','Older shower valves can deliver scalding water when a toilet flushes. A real burn risk for kids and seniors.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',400,750,1500,25,'Medium'),
('PL-030','plumbing','Laundry Box / Washer Hoses','Laundry room','Rubber washing machine hoses','Rubber hoses burst. A braided stainless replacement costs very little and prevents a flooded floor.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Replace',60,120,250,10,'Medium'),
('PL-031','plumbing','Cross Connection / Backflow','Hose bibs, laundry tub, irrigation','No backflow preventer on hose bibs or irrigation','Without a backflow preventer, contaminated water can be siphoned back into your drinking water.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',60,180,500,20,'Medium'),
('PL-032','plumbing','Water Pressure','Whole house','Pressure over 80 psi / no PRV','High incoming pressure stresses every fixture, appliance, and joint in the house.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',400,800,1600,15,'Medium'),
('PL-033','plumbing','Water Softener','Mechanical room','Not functioning / bypassed','Calgary has hard water. A softener protects your water heater and fixtures from scale buildup.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',1500,2600,4500,15,'Medium'),
('PL-034','plumbing','Water Filtration','Mechanical room or under sink','No filtration / expired cartridges','Optional but common upgrade. Whole-home or point-of-use filtration.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',400,1200,3000,12,'Medium'),
('PL-035','plumbing','Gas Piping to Appliances','Mechanical room and to appliances','Corroded, unsupported, or missing sediment trap','Gas line deficiencies must be corrected by a licensed gas fitter. Not a DIY item.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',350,800,2000,0,'Medium'),
('PL-036','plumbing','Floor Drain','Basement floor','Dry trap / no trap primer','A dry floor drain lets sewer gas into the basement. A trap primer keeps water in it.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',150,400,900,0,'Medium'),
('PL-037','plumbing','Hose Bib / Irrigation Shutoff','Outside and mechanical room','No interior shutoff for exterior taps','Without an interior shutoff you can''t winterize the outside taps, and Calgary freezes will split the pipe.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',200,400,800,25,'Medium'),
('PL-038','plumbing','Whole Home Water Leak Detection','Mechanical room at the main line','No automatic shutoff device','A smart valve that detects a leak and shuts the water off automatically. Some insurers offer a discount.','LOW','minor','Monitor / upgrade','Replace',800,1500,2800,15,'Medium'),
('IN-001','interior','Drywall - Walls & Ceilings','Throughout the house','Nail pops','Small round bumps where a fastener has pushed through. Cosmetic, caused by normal lumber shrinkage.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Repair',150,250,400,0,'Medium'),
('IN-002','interior','Drywall - Walls & Ceilings','Throughout the house','Cracks at corners of doors and windows','Diagonal cracks from door and window corners are usually normal settlement, but repeat cracking after repair points to movement.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',150,300,600,0,'Medium'),
('IN-003','interior','Drywall - Walls & Ceilings','Throughout the house','Water stains on ceiling','A brown ring means water got through at some point. The key question is whether it is still active.','MEDIUM','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,550,1200,0,'Medium'),
('IN-004','interior','Drywall','Throughout the house','New drywall installation (basement or reno)','Installing new drywall in an unfinished or gutted space.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Replace',1200,2400,4500,60,'Medium'),
('IN-005','interior','Interior Paint','Throughout the house','Worn, dated, or damaged paint','Cosmetic refresh. Also the cheapest way to make a home feel updated.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Service',2400,4200,7000,10,'Medium'),
('IN-006','interior','Flooring - Carpet','Bedrooms, basements','Worn, stained, or odour-retaining carpet','Carpet at the end of its life. Also a common source of lingering pet odour.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',2400,3900,6000,12,'Medium'),
('IN-007','interior','Flooring - Luxury Vinyl Plank','Main floors, basements','Replacement / upgrade','Durable and water resistant. The most common flooring choice in Calgary basements.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',4800,6400,8800,25,'High'),
('IN-008','interior','Flooring - Hardwood','Main living areas','Cupping, gapping, or water damage','Wood floors that have absorbed moisture and deformed. Cupping across the boards points to moisture from below.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Replace',8000,10400,12800,50,'High'),
('IN-009','interior','Flooring - Hardwood','Main living areas','Refinishing (sand and recoat)','Sanding and refinishing existing hardwood instead of replacing it. Much cheaper if the wood is thick enough.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Service',2800,4400,6400,0,'Medium'),
('IN-010','interior','Flooring - Tile','Bathrooms, entries, kitchen','Cracked tiles or failing grout','Cracked tile often points to subfloor movement, not just a dropped object.','LOW','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',900,1800,3500,50,'Medium'),
('IN-011','interior','Subfloor','Under the finished floor','Squeaking / movement / deflection','Squeaky floors are usually loose fasteners. Real bounce points to undersized or damaged framing.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Repair',250,700,2000,0,'Medium'),
('IN-012','interior','Egress Window - Basement Bedroom','Basement bedroom','No code-compliant egress window','Any basement bedroom legally needs a window large enough to escape through in a fire. This is a life-safety requirement.','CRITICAL','critical','Immediate','Replace',4000,5500,8000,25,'High'),
('IN-013','interior','Basement Suite - Legal Compliance','Basement','Non-conforming secondary suite','An illegal suite can force removal, void insurance, and kill a mortgage. Legalizing it means egress, fire separation, and permits.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',8000,20000,45000,0,'Medium'),
('IN-014','interior','Interior Doors','Throughout the house','Rubbing, sticking, or not latching','A door that suddenly sticks can mean the house is moving. One door is normal wear; several in the same area is worth a closer look.','LOW','minor','Monitor','Repair',80,180,400,40,'Medium'),
('IN-015','interior','Stairs & Handrails','Stairwells','Missing handrail or graspable rail','Code requires a graspable handrail on stairs with more than three risers. Falls on stairs are a leading home injury.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',250,600,1400,0,'Medium'),
('IN-016','interior','Stairs','Stairwells','Uneven riser heights / inadequate tread depth','Inconsistent stair heights cause trips. A difference over 3/8in between risers is a code violation.','MEDIUM','moderate','1-2 years','Repair',1200,2800,6000,0,'Medium'),
('IN-017','interior','Guardrails - Open Sides / Landings','Landings, lofts, open stairs','Missing guard or balusters over 4in apart','A child can slip through a gap wider than 4 inches. Guards are required at any drop over 600mm.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',500,1200,2800,0,'Medium'),
('IN-018','interior','Mould - Visible Growth','Bathrooms, basements, behind furniture on exterior walls','Visible mould on surfaces','Mould means there is a moisture problem. Cleaning it without fixing the moisture source guarantees it comes back.','HIGH','critical','30-90 days','Repair',800,2000,6000,0,'High'),
